What is the output of the following interface polymorphism snippet?
```java
interface Printer {
    void print();
}
class LaserPrinter implements Printer {
    public void print() {
        System.out.print("Laser ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Printer p = new LaserPrinter();
        p.print();
    }
}
```

