What is the output of the following program?
```java
abstract class BaseCompute {
    int compute(int x) {
        return process(x) * 2;
    }
    abstract int process(int x);
}
class SquareCompute extends BaseCompute {
    @Override
    int process(int x) {
        return x * x;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BaseCompute bc = new SquareCompute();
        System.out.println(bc.compute(3));
    }
}
```

